      "desk_query": "Term sheet G09 states the underlying index is \"Total Return (Type I under the Index Methodology): no cash return or financing cost accrues in the volatility control process\", while the booking record carries index_return_treatment = excess_return. Both extractors agree on the term sheet reading, so the booking appears inconsistent with the documented return treatment. Please confirm whether the note was traded on the Total Return version of the index and, if so, authorise correction of index_return_treatment to total_return; if the desk intends an excess return index, identify the index version and methodology type actually referenced.",
